{"id": "197632", "revid": "2441334", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=197632", "title": "Utaj\u00e4rvi", "text": "Utaj\u00e4rvi is a municipality in Eastern Oulu region, Finland. \nUnderstand.\nUtaj\u00e4rvi is located near the Oulujoki River.\nGet in.\nThe nearest highway is the national road 22 between Oulu and Kajaani.\nPassenger train stops at.\nGet around.\nBy bus.\nCoaches passing by can be used, see Matkahuolto.\nConnect.\nInternet.\nMany places of business may have Wi-Fi for customers (although it's usually called \"WLAN\"); ask the staff for details.\nFor free Wi-Fi and internet terminals, check the.\nStay safe.\nIn emergencies, \u260f. This includes social services, although for non-urgent matters you could contact the social services directly."}
